Description: Remove the packagechooser module from Calamares' sequence
 Upstream's package chooser appends desktop-environment blocks to the generated
 configuration.nix, and the target host imports that file, so a choice made in
 the wizard would stack on top of the desktop this flake already declares.
 .
 The unfree notesqml instance goes with it, since it exists only to explain that
 page. A dozen downstream branches in modules/nixos/main.py read the
 globalstorage key the module used to write, which
 packagechooser-default-globalstorage-key.patch supplies instead.
Forwarded: not-needed

diff --git a/config/settings.conf b/config/settings.conf
--- a/config/settings.conf
+++ b/config/settings.conf
@@ -83,9 +83,6 @@ instances:
 #
 # YAML: list of maps of string:string key-value pairs.
 instances:
-- id:       unfree
-  module:   notesqml
-  config:   unfree.conf
 - module:   nixos
   weight:   48
 
@@ -117,8 +114,6 @@ sequence:
   - locale
   - keyboard
   - users
-  - packagechooser
-  - notesqml@unfree
   - partition
   - summary
 - exec:
